OL,3,GNEWSAMayor wants meeting with home
OL,4,Asecretary over Linton asylum plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FYork and North Yorkshire's elected
OL,7,FLabour mayor David Skaith wants to meet
OL,8,FHome Secretary Shabana Mahmood over
OL,9,Fplans to turn the former Linton-on-Ouse
OL,10,FRAF base into an asylum centre.
OL,12,FSkaith said the village's residents
OL,13,Fdeserved "really good engagement" on
OL,14,Fthe issue.
OL,16,FThe Home Office, which has been
OL,17,Fcontacted for comment, is considering
OL,18,Fusing the site, near York, to house up
OL,19,Fto 1,200 asylum seekers - although no
OL,20,Ffinal decision has been made.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
